  "description": "TOJXIC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H122 Dy10 N8 O54,8(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1F (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2F (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3F (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy4F (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5F (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 13 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.585-4.138 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.98-119.06°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C96H138Dy10N8O62. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 10 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
